From 1cb21f9075f1959da6b6ff8ff91985085436ffe0 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: raold <868138+raold@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 14 Nov 2026 08:26:51 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] Let other modules move bots out of a boss mechanic as it is
 cast

A module may install a PlayerbotMechanicGuard. Every combat strategy then
has a "mechanic move" trigger and action: while the guard has a mechanic
in force that binds the bot, the bot makes a forced move to the spot the
guard names (out of the mechanic's area, onto its stack point, away from
the others), and MoveTo refuses an ordinary move back into it. Forced
moves, a raid strategy's own included, are never refused. Nothing changes
until a guard is installed.
